From e281ae5f83138537baca4a6eac9bde2155c1ec3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fabrizio Catitti <fabrizio.catitti@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:24:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(voice): Alexa voice control while Nuvio is in the
 foreground

Adds a relay-based Alexa integration:
- core/voice: VoiceCommandBus (priority-ordered handlers), VoiceCommandClient
  (OkHttp WebSocket to the relay, opened in onStart / closed in onStop)
- Player handles pause/resume/seek/seek-to/next episode/skip intro/close
  via existing PlayerEvents; app-level handler handles voice search
- alexa/relay-worker: Cloudflare Worker + Durable Object with Alexa request
  signature verification and skill-ID pinning
- alexa/skill: it-IT interaction model ("nuvio tv")

Configure with VOICE_RELAY_URL / VOICE_RELAY_TOKEN in local.properties;
disabled when blank.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
