From: Fabrizio Catitti <fabrizio.catitti@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:23:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] chore(voice): log each relay step and handle relay errors

Logs skill-id mismatches, the mapped command and the TV reply so
`wrangler tail` shows where a request stops; relay failures now produce
a spoken error instead of an invalid response.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQ7oit84w6xrrRhN57hYZw
---
